stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IdentityChecking
    IdentityChecking --> BlockedIdentity: identity drift
    IdentityChecking --> OrderChecking: identity matches
    OrderChecking --> BlockedOrder: stage order invalid
    OrderChecking --> StageChecking: order valid
    StageChecking --> BlockedStage: missing / unknown / invalid stage
    StageChecking --> EvidenceChecking: states and digests match
    EvidenceChecking --> BlockedEvidence: readback / approval / audit missing
    EvidenceChecking --> PipelineReady: all evidence bound
    PipelineReady --> Handoff: next executor decides
    Handoff --> [*]
    BlockedIdentity --> [*]
    BlockedOrder --> [*]
    BlockedStage --> [*]
    BlockedEvidence --> [*]
